Architecture is documentation-first, while an experimental vertical
slice is implemented to validate runtime and host boundaries.
Production runtime implementation has not started.
```

这样更准确。

另外 `bitty-ai-docs/TODO.md` 还写着：

> Later phase: wire this repository into bitty-ai as the docs/ submodule once the implementation repository exists.

但这个已经完成了。

而且最新 `bitty-ai` main commit 本身就是同步 docs gitlink。这个 TODO 应该立即清掉。

